title: 经济扩张
subtitle: 经济正在稳步增长。
new-page: true
view-if: economic_expansion >= 85 and unemployed <= 6 and inflation <= 6 and spd_in_government
on-arrival: economic_expansion = 0; expansion_seen += 1; capital_strike_progress -= 2 if capital_strike_progress >= 2 and not class_war; capital_strike_progress -= 1 if peoples_party and sapd_consolidated and not capital_rejected and (labor_strength < reformist_strength or capital_spd) and not capital_flight; budget += 1; workers_spd += 4*(1-dissent) if spd_in_government; new_middle_spd += 2*(1-dissent) if spd_in_government; old_middle_spd += 2*(1-dissent) if spd_in_government; rural_spd += 2*(1-dissent) if spd_in_government; new_middle_ddp += 5 if in_weimar_coalition or in_grand_coalition or in_popular_front; workers_kpd += 3 if in_popular_front or in_left_front; old_middle_dvp += 4 if in_grand_coalition; new_middle_dvp += 3 if in_grand_coalition; inflation += 0.4; socialism += class_war if class_war; socialism -= ((reformist_strength/10)*bourgeois_power) if not in_popular_front or in_left_front
tags: event

= 经济扩张

德国经济在较长时期内稳步增长,通胀与失业都处于低位。税率不变,政府却因额外的税收而受益。[? if not class_war : 连资本家都觉得,就政府政策而言,他们没什么好抱怨的。 ?][? if class_war : 我们经济的成功被归功于社会主义,后者正获得广泛支持。 ?] 不过,这种经济增长的一个弊端是通胀风险的上升。

[? if capital_strike_progress < 0 and expansion_seen >= 2 and not in_grand_coalition and peoples_party : 在我们治理下的经济增长已达到这样的程度:一些工业家开始转而对社会民主抱有认同 —— 至少是我们所采取的这种形态。 ?]

- @welcome_industry: [? if not capital_spd : 嗯,全民党就是全民党嘛…… ?][? if capital_spd : <span style="color:rgb(170,150,60);font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.5px;">照常做生意,很愉快。</span> ?]
- @ew: 他们不想公开冲突,这挺好,但我们仍然反对他们的利益。

@welcome_industry
view-if: capital_strike_progress < 0 and expansion_seen >= 2 and not in_grand_coalition and peoples_party and not capital_flight
subtitle: +3 资源
on-arrival: resources += 3; bourgeois_power += 0.02; left_dissent += 10; center_dissent += 10; labor_dissent += 5; bourgeoisie_spd += (2*economic_growth)*(1-dissent); bourgeoisie_dvp -= economic_growth; socialism -= (spd_votes*bourgeois_power)/10; capital_spd += 2; old_middle_spd += 5*bourgeois_power; new_middle_spd += 5*bourgeois_power; rural_spd += (5-land_reform)*bourgeois_power; kpd_relation -= 20

我们不是一个会因经济阶级而拒绝支持者的政党;自我们成为全民党以来,便已放弃了那种做法。公司也是人嘛。这不过是我们政策的自然演进。

